WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.620
- As you probably know, Rudy Giuliani

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.950
has been suspended from
the practice of law

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:06.580
indefinitely and he may be disbarred soon,

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.210
but what's going to happen now

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.820
and can he still practice?

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.070
Well, I was curious about that.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:11.903
So, I looked it up.

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:14.410
A lot of people thought he
was only barred in New York.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.920
That's not actually true.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.540
Rudy Giuliani is also barred
in the District of Columbia.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.540
Side note, this is
important because he filed

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.070
an affidavit in one of
the election related cases

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.940
where he said that he was
a member of good standing

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.460
of the DC bar, in fact, he
hadn't been paying his dues.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.260
So, he was not in fact in good standing.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.130
People were wondering whether
that meant that he had

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.690
perjured himself in those election cases.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.860
But, the more important point
is that now that he's been

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.010
suspended in New York,
according to the DC bar rules,

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.250
he has an affirmative
obligation to notify DC

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.350
about the suspension and presumably DC

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.550
will issue a reciprocal
suspension against Giuliani.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.620
So he's not going to be able
to practice in New York.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.951
He's not gonna be able to
practice in DC and we're not going

00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:56.170
to see Rudy Giuliani
in court, anytime soon.

